@startuml
[*] --> Greeting : User arrives
Greeting --> WaitingForPIN : Card inserted / Get PIN

state WaitingForPIN
state ValidatingPIN
state MainMenu
state ProcessingRequest
state Ejecting
state Confiscating

WaitingForPIN --> ValidatingPIN : PIN entered / Validate PIN
ValidatingPIN --> MainMenu : Correct PIN / Display options

MainMenu --> ProcessingRequest : Option selected / Process request
ProcessingRequest --> Ejecting : Request rejected / Eject
ProcessingRequest --> Confiscating : Card issues detected / Confiscate

ValidatingPIN --> WaitingForPIN : Invalid PIN / Invalid PIN prompt
ValidatingPIN --> Confiscating : Third invalid PIN / Confiscate

WaitingForPIN --> Ejecting : Cancel operation / Eject
ValidatingPIN --> Ejecting : Cancel during validation / Eject
MainMenu --> Ejecting : Cancel during menu / Eject
ProcessingRequest --> Ejecting : Cancel during processing / Eject

Confiscating --> Ejecting : Card confiscated / Eject after confiscation
@enduml
